<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26048" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατέμνω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατελ-τάμνω</span></b>  (q.v.), fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τεμῶ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut through, cut in twain,
				dissever,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ δὲ γλῶσσαν τάμε μέσσην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.618
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				522
			</span></i> (tm.), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.139
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ κάρα τεμών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					799.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ κῦμα τεμών</span>
			<i>cleaving</i> the wave, ib.<i><span class="en">
				271.5
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διχῇ γαῖαν δ.</span>
			<i>part</i> it asunder, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				545
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίχα δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					190d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					280b
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>disunite,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατετ μηκότα τὴν πολιτείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.207
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cut up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.41
			</span></i>.</div>
